{#
  THE CORRECTION TO A NOMINEE'S VOTING LETTER: a BODY dropped into the house shell, like
  emails/nominee-voting.twig, whose community-return table it repeats.

  Sent by Services\NomineeVotingNotice::sendCorrections() — pressed by a person — to each
  nominee whose letter stated a community-return rule the edition no longer runs. It says
  the earlier letter was wrong, apologises, and states the rule that applies, read from the
  same NomineeVotingNotice::communityReturn() the letter reads, so the correction cannot
  describe a third rule. The reissued letter travels as the attachment.

  Type is on REFERENCE §6.2's ladder in px (right for mail); every colour is `c.<token>`
  from Accent::mail().
#}
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:{{ c.ink }}">A correction to your nomination letter</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:{{ c.ink }}">Dear {{ name }},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:{{ c['ink-2'] }}">{{ lead }}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:{{ c['ink-2'] }}">{{ after }}</p>

{% if community_return|default([]) %}
<p style="margin:10px 0 8px;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:{{ c.ink }}">Your community return</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin:0 0 22px;border-top:1px solid {{ c.line }}">
  {% for r in community_return %}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;width:150px;vertical-align:top;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:{{ c.ink }};border-bottom:1px solid {{ c.line }}">{{ r[0] }}</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 0;vertical-align:top;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:{{ c['ink-2'] }};border-bottom:1px solid {{ c.line }}">{{ r[1] }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
{% endif %}

<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:{{ c.soft }}">
  Reference <span style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace">{{ reference }}</span> ·
  <a href="{{ vote_url }}" style="color:{{ c.green }}">Your voting page</a> ·
  <a href="{{ rules_url }}" style="color:{{ c.green }}">This award’s rules, community return included</a>
</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:{{ c.ink }}">
  Yours sincerely,<br>
  {% if signatory %}<strong style="font-weight:600">{{ signatory }}</strong><br>{{ signatory_title }}<br>{% else %}<strong style="font-weight:600">{{ signatory_title }}</strong><br>{% endif %}For and on behalf of Africa GATES
</p>
